      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsections: \"(1A) The Chairman of the Promotion Committee and two other members of the Promotion Committee shall form a quorum at all meetings of the Promotion Committee. (lB) If on any question to be determined there is an equality of votes, the Chairman of the Promotion Committee shall have the casting vote in addition to his original vote, (Ic) The Promotion Committee shall have powers to determine the conduct of its proceedings.\"; and"
      }
    },
