      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_20",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "20",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_20__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_20__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_20__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 46 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_20__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_20",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting after the words \"Where any\" the words \"sum of money by way of and after the word \"contributions\" the words \"together with any dividend due thereon\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_20__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_20",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by renumbering section 46 as subsection 46(1); and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_20__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_20",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: \"(2) In this the word \"contribution\" shall be deemed to include any dividend and interest due on any contributions.\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_21",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "21",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 47 of the principal Act is amended by"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "substituting for subsection (1) the following subsection (1): \"(1) Notwithstanding any contract to the contrary, the employer shall not be entitled to deduct or otherwise recover from the wages or remuneration of the employee, the employer's contribution, from the employee.\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_22",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "22",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 48 of the principal Act is amended by"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "deleting subsection (6)."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_23",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "23",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 50 of the principal Act is amended by"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "inserting after the words \"at the rate of the word \"last\" in subparagraph (a)(ii) of the proviso to subsection (2)."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_24",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "24",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "50A. section 50 the following section: Additional 50A. In addition to payment of dividend paid payment of under the proviso to section 50(2), the Board dividend. may pay to the member of the Fund who has made a withdrawal under section 54(1), an additional dividend as determined by the Board.\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_25",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "25",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 51 of the principal Act is amended by"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "substituting for the colon after the words \"any such sum or amount\" with a full stop and by deleting the proviso."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_26",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "26",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_26__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_26__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 54 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_26__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_26",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsections (1), (2), (3) and (4) the following subsections: \"(1) No sum of money standing to the credit of a member of the Fund may be withdrawn except with the authority of the Board, and subject to any rules made under this section, such authority shall not be given unless the Board is satisfied that— (a) the member of the Fund has died; (b) the member of the Fund has attained the age of fifty-five years; (c) the member of the Fund is physically or mentally incapacitated engaging in any further employment; or (d) the member of the Fund not being a Malaysian citizen is about to leave Malaysia with no intention of returning thereto. (2) When a withdrawal under sub- section(l)(b) has been made of any amount standing to the credit of the member of the Fund, the member shall not thereafter be treated as an employee unless he has given to the Board and his employer, notice in such manner and form as may be prescribed by the Board, his intention to contribute: Provided that the member of the Fund who has contributed under subsection (2), shall only be allowed to make a subsequent withdrawal under subsection (1)(b), (1)(c) or (1)(d) and subsequently after he has made any such withdrawal, he shall cease to be a member of the Fund and shall be precluded from making any further contributions. (3) Notwithstanding subsection (1) the Board may authorize application of withdrawal from the Fund partly any amount standing to the credit of the member of the Fund and, subject to any rules made under this section, and such authority shall not be given unless the Board is satisfied that a member of the Fund— (a) has attained the age of fifty years; (b) has purchased or built a house; (c) has purchased or built a house and has taken a loan made on the security of a charge on the said house for its purchase or construction; (d) has purchased or built a house and has taken a loan under paragraph 26(1)(f) for its purchase or construction; or (e) or any other person approved by the Board, require medical financing. (4) Notwithstanding subsection (3), the Minister may prescribe the amount the Board may authorize for withdrawal under the same subsection.\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_26__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_26",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words \"subsection (3)(b)\" the words \"subsection (3)\" in subsection (5)."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_27",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "27",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "section 55 the following section: 55. (1) Notwithstanding section 54(1), any Periodical payment member of the Fund who has attained the age in lieu of lump sum of fifty-five years may— payment. (a) apply to withdraw the amount standing to his credit in periodical payments in lieu of a lump sum payment; or (b) apply to withdraw dividend only on the amount standing to his credit in lieu of a lump sum payment, and the Board may, subject to any rules made under this section, authorize such withdrawal. (2) Where the Board has authorized withdrawal under paragraph (a) of subsection (1), the member of the Fund shall be precluded from withdrawing the amount standing to his credit under section 54(1)(b).\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_28",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "28",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 58 of the principal Act is amended by"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: \"(1A) Notwithstanding subsection (1), the Board may not pay the additional amount, if the Board is satisfied that no person as approved by the Board survived the member of the Fund.\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_29",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "29",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "section 63 the following section: 63. (1) Notwithstanding the provision of any other written law, where an employer is found guilty of an offence under section 43(2) or 48(3), the Court before which the employer is found guilty shall order such employer to pay to the Fund the amount of contributions, together with any dividend credited thereon, due and payable to the Board and certified by an officer authorized by the Board to be due from such employer, prior to the date of such finding of guilt. (2) Where an employer is found guilty of an offence under section 45(3), the Court before which the employer is found guilty shall order such employer to pay to the Fund any amount of dividend thereon due and payable to the Board and certified by an officer authorized by the Board to be due from such employer. (3) A court order issued under subsection (1) or (2) or both shall be paid by the employer in a single payment at the date the order was issued except if the Court is satisfied that the employer has no capability in terms of financial and on special reasons the offence was committed, the Court may order the arrears of contributions to be paid in not more than six monthly instalments from the date of the order. (4) Where an employer fails to comply with any order made under subsection (3), the Court shall issue a warrant to levy the whole amount of such arrears by way of distress and sale of the employer's property in accordance with the same procedure of execution under rule 30 of the Subordinate Courts Rules 1980 and this rule shall apply mutatis mutandis notwithstanding the amount ordered for arrears of contribution or dividend or both.\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1__para_d",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1__para_e",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1__para_f",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1__para_g",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1__para_h",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1__para_i"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 2 of the Employees Provident Fund Act 1991, which in this Act is referred to as the \"principal Act\", is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words \"section 26\" the words \"section 26A\" in paragraph (c) of the definition of \"approved company\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting the words \"who has attained the age of sixteen years\" in the definition of \"employee\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of \"Fund\" the following definition: ' \"gratuity\" means any payment paid by an employer to an employee upon completion of service or voluntary resignation as a recognition of such employee's service;';"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting the words \"and includes a Probationary Inspector\" in the definition of \"Inspector\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of \"member\" the following definition: ' \"Minister\" means the Minister charged with responsibility for matters relating to the Employees Provident Fund Board;';"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1__para_f",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "f",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of \"new scheme\" the following definition: ' \"overtime payment\" means any payment due from an employer to an employee for work carried out in excess of the normal working hours of such employee and includes any payment paid to an employee for work carried out on public holidays and rest days;';"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1__para_g",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "g",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of \"person\" the following definition: ' \"retirement benefit\" means any payment paid to an employee upon retirement either compulsory or optional or on medical grounds as stated under the contract of service of the employee;';"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1__para_h",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "h",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of \"service charge\" the following definition: ' \"special housing loan\" means any loan to an approved company solely for the purpose of relending to borrowers for the purchase of low cost houses;'; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1__para_i",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the definition of \"wages\"— (i) by deleting the word \"or\" at the end of paragraph (c): (ii) by substituting for the full stop at the end of paragraph (d) the word \"; or\"; and (iii) by inserting after paragraph (d) the following paragraphs: \"(e) retrenchment, lay-off or termination benefits; (f) any travelling allowance or the value of any concession; or (g) any other remuneration or payment as may be exempted by the Minister.\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_3__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@/~cl_3__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/40/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 4(4) of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
