        "@value": "paragraph 12(b) the following paragraph: \"(c) declare any person or class of persons employed, engaged or contracted with to carry out work in any occupation in any agricultural or industrial undertaking, constructional work, trade, business or place of work as an employee or employees and the person who employs, involves or contracts with each of the person or class of persons above-mentioned, shall be deemed to be an employer and such employer and employee shall be deemed to have made a contract of service with each other and the Minister may determine any payment received by the person above-mentioned to be wages for the purpose of this Act;\"."
