        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "shares of any public company listed on the stock exchange established in Malaysia and buying of new shares, the issue or sale of which has been approved under the Securities Industry Act 1983, in any public limited company incorporated in Malaysia which is listed on a stock exchange in Malaysia or the listing of which on a stock exchange in Malaysia has been approved under the Securities Industry Act 1983; or"
      }
